  "design_notes": [
    "The primary suite is now dominant: 31.1 m2 bedroom, 17.6 m2 bathroom and 17.6 m2 dressing/filter.",
    "The primary bathroom is L-shaped across M-B and M-B-A; the two zones are one room in programme accounting.",
    "Laundry moves to PB storage behind the Great Wall, preserving the open hall and releasing P2 area.",
    "Every enclosed P2 room retains an explicit, geometrically validated door or opening.",
    "A retractable rear exterior stair is reserved for security and second-route study but is not credited as a compliant exit.",
    "The X=21 view remains primary; one large exposed industrial truss is acceptable, small decorative trusses are not.",
    "Four D-048 column reservations remain at the protected stair corners; no section is selected.",
    "Site orientation remains intentionally reversible.",
    "P2-W01 dry interior acoustic partitions are coordinated at 250 mm nominal under D-057; wet, hot-side, exterior, protected-stair and technical wall types remain separate design tasks."
